  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:00.060" end="00:06.860" ttm:agent="v1">Eres una obra de arte</p>
      <p begin="00:06.860" end="00:12.170" ttm:agent="v1">Con solo mirarte</p>
      <p begin="00:12.170" end="00:16.930" ttm:agent="v1">Algo que da paz</p>
      <p begin="00:16.930" end="00:18.430" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Hi, is this Prodigy?)</p>
      <p begin="00:18.100" end="00:20.430" ttm:agent="v1">Said, &quot;Girl, you so fine&quot;, wanna make you mine</p>
      <p begin="00:20.430" end="00:23.050" ttm:agent="v1">But you always fuckin' playin' and be wastin' all my time</p>
      <p begin="00:23.050" end="00:25.740" ttm:agent="v1">Like, you's a fuckin' thot, but I'm still up on your line</p>
      <p begin="00:25.740" end="00:27.980" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Every time I'm in my head (ayy, ayy, ayy), you is always in my mind</p>
      <p begin="00:27.980" end="00:30.930" ttm:agent="v1">Now I'm countin' big checks, big flex on you bitches</p>
      <p begin="00:30.930" end="00:33.720" ttm:agent="v1">If you talkin' all that shit, I'ma leave yo' ass with stitches, ayy</p>
      <p begin="00:33.720" end="00:35.740" ttm:agent="v1">If that's your bitch, why she all up in my mentions?</p>
      <p begin="00:35.740" end="00:37.600" ttm:agent="v1">Girl, I wanna be with you, but all these thotties I be ditchin'</p>
      <p begin="00:37.600" end="00:39.880" ttm:agent="v1">Said, &quot;Girl, you so fine&quot;, wanna make you mine</p>
      <p begin="00:39.880" end="00:42.470" ttm:agent="v1">But you always fuckin' playin' and be wastin' all my time</p>
      <p begin="00:42.470" end="00:44.520" ttm:agent="v1">Like, you's a fuckin' thot, but I'm still up on your line</p>
      <p begin="00:44.520" end="00:46.930" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Every time I'm in my head (ayy, ayy, ayy), you is always in my mind</p>
      <p begin="00:46.930" end="00:50.120" ttm:agent="v1">Now I'm countin' big checks, big flex on you bitches</p>
      <p begin="00:50.120" end="00:52.710" ttm:agent="v1">If you talkin' all that shit, I'ma leave yo' ass with stitches, ayy</p>
      <p begin="00:52.710" end="00:54.990" ttm:agent="v1">If that's your bitch, why she all up in my mentions?</p>
      <p begin="00:54.990" end="00:57.210" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Girl, I wanna be with you (ayy, ayy, ayy), but all these thotties I be ditchin'</p>
      <p begin="00:57.210" end="00:58.710" ttm:agent="v1">Like, damn</p>
      <p begin="00:58.430" end="00:59.930" ttm:agent="v1">That bitch, she playin' like Atari</p>
      <p begin="00:59.770" end="01:01.950" ttm:agent="v1">But she won't be fuckin' playin' when I'm whippin' in a 'Rari</p>
      <p begin="01:01.950" end="01:04.430" ttm:agent="v1">I ain't fuckin' with these broke boys, shout-out Playboi Carti</p>
      <p begin="01:04.430" end="01:06.920" ttm:agent="v1">You existin' as a broke toy, don't know you, bitch, I'm sorry</p>
      <p begin="01:06.920" end="01:09.380" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Like, what? (Like, what?) I got thotties on my line</p>
      <p begin="01:09.380" end="01:11.690" ttm:agent="v1">If you won't be talkin' money, lil' bitch, you wastin' time</p>
      <p begin="01:11.690" end="01:13.190" ttm:agent="v1">Like, sorry, bitch, not sorry</p>
      <p begin="01:12.900" end="01:14.400" ttm:agent="v1">Think you gotta wait in line</p>
      <p begin="01:14.030" end="01:15.530" ttm:agent="v1">I'ma pass her to the next, yeah</p>
      <p begin="01:15.160" end="01:16.660" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I'ma pass her to the guys (ayy)</p>
      <p begin="01:16.460" end="01:18.590" ttm:agent="v1">Like, fuckin' shit, I fuck with bitches</p>
      <p begin="01:18.590" end="01:21.020" ttm:agent="v1">Sellin' out my shows in Venice, Uzi mentions</p>
      <p begin="01:21.020" end="01:23.280" ttm:agent="v1">I just need like 20 minutes, heart with stitches</p>
      <p begin="01:23.280" end="01:25.380" ttm:agent="v1">Leavin' me all in the ditches, start to finish</p>
      <p begin="01:25.380" end="01:28.060" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Damn, like, fuck (like, fuck), run it up (run it up)</p>
      <p begin="01:28.060" end="01:30.330" ttm:agent="v1">Bitch, bust it down, and you know that she a dub</p>
      <p begin="01:30.330" end="01:32.630" ttm:agent="v1">I be in and out of town, and you never showin' up</p>
      <p begin="01:32.630" end="01:35.040" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I can never trust a thot (ayy, ayy), gotta keep a .40 tucked</p>
      <p begin="01:35.040" end="01:37.480" ttm:agent="v1">Said, &quot;Girl, you so fine&quot;, wanna make you mine</p>
      <p begin="01:37.480" end="01:39.950" ttm:agent="v1">But you always fuckin' playin' and be wastin' all my time</p>
      <p begin="01:39.950" end="01:42.490" ttm:agent="v1">Like, you's a fuckin' thot, but I'm still up on your line</p>
      <p begin="01:42.490" end="01:44.780" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Every time I'm in my head (ayy, ayy, ayy), you is always in my mind</p>
      <p begin="01:44.780" end="01:47.530" ttm:agent="v1">Now I'm countin' big checks, big flex on you bitches</p>
      <p begin="01:47.530" end="01:50.260" ttm:agent="v1">If you talkin' all that shit, I'ma leave yo' ass with stitches, ayy</p>
      <p begin="01:50.260" end="01:52.300" ttm:agent="v1">If that's your bitch, why she all up in my mentions?</p>
      <p begin="01:52.300" end="01:54.370" ttm:agent="v1">Girl, I wanna be with you, but all these thotties I be ditchin'</p>
      <p begin="01:54.370" end="01:56.680" ttm:agent="v1">Said, &quot;Girl, you so fine&quot;, wanna make you mine</p>
      <p begin="01:56.680" end="01:59.110" ttm:agent="v1">But you always fuckin' playin' and be wastin' all my time</p>
      <p begin="01:59.110" end="02:01.570" ttm:agent="v1">Like, you's a fuckin' thot, but I'm still up on your line</p>
      <p begin="02:01.570" end="02:03.900" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Every time I'm in my head (ayy, ayy, ayy), you is always in my mind</p>
      <p begin="02:03.900" end="02:07.050" ttm:agent="v1">Now I'm countin' big checks, big flex on you bitches</p>
      <p begin="02:07.050" end="02:09.540" ttm:agent="v1">If you talkin' all that shit, I'ma leave yo' ass with stitches, ayy</p>
      <p begin="02:09.540" end="02:11.750" ttm:agent="v1">If that's your bitch, why she all up in my mentions?</p>
      <p begin="02:11.750" end="02:15.110" ttm:agent="v1">Girl, I wanna be with you, but all these thotties I be ditchin'</p>
      <p begin="02:15.110" end="02:18.480" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="02:18.480" end="02:19.980" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(The world is yours)</p>
